{
  "title": "Memberships: Sell Access and Open Content to Members | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A membership turns a purchase into access. With the CrestApps Memberships feature, a product puts its buyer in a role for a year, a month or for good; the Role Picker keeps content for members; buying again adds days; and a membership ends on its end date, when its order is canceled or refunded in full, or when you choose End now.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why memberships, and how product, roles and content fit together\n• Selling a membership: the Memberships sample, a role and the days\n• Keeping content for members with the Role Picker\n• Buying a membership, and what a member sees\n• Managing and ending memberships\n• Use cases",
